# Keep documentation up to date

After any code or behavior change in this repo, update docs in the **same turn** before finishing.

## Required updates

| Changed | Update |
|---------|--------|
| Features, UX, CLI, user workflow | `README.md` |
| Architecture, services, project layout | `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` |
| Plan/scope/phases | `PLAN.md` if the plan itself changed |
| User-visible or notable technical change | Append entry to `docs/CHANGELOG.md` (date + short bullets) |

## Rules

- Do not leave docs describing removed or renamed APIs, settings, or UI labels
- Prefer short factual edits over rewriting whole docs
- If a change is internal-only (refactor with same behavior), still note it briefly in `CHANGELOG.md` when it affects maintainability
- Never skip doc updates because the change “is small” — adjust the matching section or add one CHANGELOG line
- Media test files (`.mkv`, `.avi`, etc.) are not part of the product; do not document them as app assets

## Example

```text
✅ Added folder-recursive import → update README usage + CHANGELOG
❌ Added folder-recursive import → only changed C# and said “done”
```
